  \resources\SystemSettings_Language_CHSPinyinIME_IsVModeEnabledDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Son, sana, vaqt va boshqalarni xitoycha formatda kiritish uchun V rejimidan foydalaning. Qo‘sh pinyin rejimi yoniqligida V rejimiga o‘tish uchun "Shift + V" tugmalarini bosing.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Language_CHSPinyinIME_IsUModeEnabledDescription:
