  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Title:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows versiyasini yangilash
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Message2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu yangilash bir muncha vaqtni olishi mumkin va ShKingiz qayta ishga tushiriladi. Yangilash yakunlanguniga qadar ShKingizdan foydalana olmaysiz.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Message1:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Versiyangizni yangilash Windows-ga yangi funksiyalarni qo‘shadi. Boshlashdan oldin ishingizni saqlaganingizga va barcha ilovalarni yopganingizga ishonch hosil qiling.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Upgrade_Button_Text:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Yangilashni boshlash
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_UNKNOWN_ERROR_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ayni paytda ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimini hozir faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti. Uni keyinroq faollashtiring yoki asl Windows versiyasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_UNACTIVATED_DOWNLEVEL_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsning ushbu versiyasi Windowsning faollashtirilmagan versiyasidan yangilangan. To‘g‘ri mahsulot kalitini kiriting yoki Windowsning litsenziyalangan nusxasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Troubleshooter_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar aktivatsiya bilan bog‘liq muammolarga duch kelayotgan bo‘lsangiz, ularni bartaraf etish uchun “Nosozliklarni tuzatish” tugmasini bosing. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TroubleshooterDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Nosozliklarni tuzatish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TOKEN_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows faollashtirish sertifikatini topa olmayapti. Windowsni faollashtirish uchun ma’muringiz haqiqiy sertifikatni o‘rnatishi lozim. 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TokenErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows faollashtirish sertifikatini topa olmayapti. Ushbu ShKda haqiqiy sertifikatni o‘rnating yoki tizimingiz ma’muri bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TOKEN:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsni hozir faollashtirib bo‘lmaydi. Keyinroq faollashtirishga qayta urinib ko‘ring. Agar bu ishlamasa, tizimingiz ma’muri bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TIMEBOMB_EXPIRING_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsning ushbu tanishtiruv versiyasi uchun berilgan litsenziyaning amal qilish muddati yaqin vaqtda tugaydi. Windowsning oxrigi versiyasini o‘rnatishingiz va faollashtirishingiz lozim bo‘ladi. Faollashtirilguniga qadar kompyuter har soatda qayta ishga tushaveradi, shuning uchun ma’lumotlaringizni saqlab borishingiz lozim.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_TIMEBASED_EXPIRED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsning ushbu verisyasining amal qilish muddati o‘tgan. Faollashtirish uchun, eng oxirgi versiyani o‘rnating.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SupportActivateInstructions_Description:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Yordam Olish yoki telefon orqali faollashtirish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionExpiredRejuv:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Your %1 subscription has expired—contact your organization’s admin for help.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionExpired:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: %1 obunasi yaroqsiz.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SubscriptionActive:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: %1 obunasi faol.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_Store_Entitlement:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows is activated with a digital license.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SOFTMOD_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: ShKda faollashtirishga to‘sqinlik qilayotgan fayllar mavjud. Windowsning yangi versiyasini sotib olishingiz va o‘rnatishingiz lozim.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_SAFE_MODE_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows tizimi xafvsiz rejimda ishlamoqda. Faollashtirish uchun tizimni oddiy rejimda qayta ishga tushiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_REBOOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows faollashtirishga to‘sqinlik qilayotgan tizim fayllaridagi o‘zgarishlarni aniqladi. Faollashtirish uchun, Windowsni qayta ishga tushiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_PhoneActivate_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows-ni faollashtirish uchun bizga qo‘ng‘iroq qiling.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_PhoneActivateDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Telefon orqali faollashtirmoq
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OpenResolutionURLDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Mijozlarga xizmat ko‘rsatish xizmat bilan bog‘laning
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ONLINE_ERROR:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsni faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti. Keyinroq qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OEM_SLP_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar Windows avval o‘rnatilgan bo‘lsa, faollashtirish uchun, ishlab chiqaruvchi yoki yig‘uvchiga murojaat qilishingiz lozim bo‘ladi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_OEM_OOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Faollashtirish bilan bog‘liq muammo mavjud. ShKingiz ishlab chiqaruvchisi bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NO_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsni faollashtirish uchun, mahsulot kalitini kiriting.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NO_KEY_FOUND:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows qurilmangizda mahsulot kaliti topilmagani haqida xabar berdi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NoPKeyFound:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Mahsulot kaliti topilmadi
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NEVER_ACTIVATED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsni faollashtirish uchun, mahsulot kalitini kiriting.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_NETWORK_UNAVAILABLE_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimi faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti, chunki ayni paytda aktivatsiya serverlarimiz ishlamayapti. Internet aloqasini tekshirib ko‘ring, keyin biz serverlar ish faoliyatiga o‘tganida Windows tizimini faollashtirishga avtomatik urinib ko‘ramiz.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LICENSE_EXPIRING_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsdan foydalanish uchun berilgan litsenziya muddati yaqin vaqtda tugaydi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LEARN_MORE:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Qo‘shimcha ma’lumot olish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LearnMore_AccessibleName:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Learn more about Windows activation
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_NotDefined_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Activation client is not defined. Please contact system administrator.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_LaunchFailed_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Activation client failed to launch. Please contact system administrator.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_ErrorMessage:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Something went wrong. Try again later.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LaunchAltClient_Description:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Launch activation client
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_LastKeyError:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Siz kiritgan oxirgi mahsulot kaliti (ID: %1) Windows’ning ushbu nusxasida ishlamaydi. (0x%2!X!)
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_KMS_NOT_FOUND:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimini faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti, chunki tashkilotingizning aktivatsiya xizmatiga bog‘lana olmayapmiz. Tashkilotingiz tarmog‘i bilan aloqa o‘rnatilganini tekshirib, keyin qaytadan urining. Agar muammo bartaraf etilmasa, tashkilotingizdan biror mutaxassis bilan maslahatlashing.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_INVALID_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ayni paytda ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimini faollashtirib bo‘lmaydi, chunki siz kiritgan mahsulot kaliti yaroqsiz. Asl Windows versiyasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IDS_TIMEBOMB_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windowsning ushbu tanishtiruv versiyasi uchun berilgan litsenziyaning amal qilish muddati o‘tdi. Oxrigi versiyani o‘rnatishingiz va faollashtirishingiz lozim bo‘ladi. Faollashtirilguniga qadar kompyuter har soatda qayta ishga tushaveradi, shuning uchun ma’lumotlaringizni saqlab boring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IDS_HARDWARE_OOT_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimini faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti, chunki siz kiritgan mahsulot kaliti kompyuteringizning apparat profiliga mos kelmayapti. Agar Windows tizimini yaqinda ta’mirlagan yoki kompyuteringiz apparat qismini sezilarli darajada o‘zgartirgan bo‘lsangiz, muammoni bartaraf etish uchun “Nosozliklarni tuzatish” tugmasini bosing yoki asl Windows versiyasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IA_HOST_NOT_ACTIVATED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows ushbu virtual mashinani faollashtira olmaydi. Xost mashina faollashtirilganligiga ishonch hosil qiling va qayta urinib ko‘ring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_IA_GENERIC_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows ushbu virtual mashinani faollashtira olmaydi. Boshqa mahsulot kalitidan foydalanishga urinib ko‘ring. Agar u ishlamasa, xost mashinangizni yangilashingizga to‘g‘ri kelishi mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_HARDWARE_ID_CHANGED:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows qurilmangiz apparat ta’minoti o‘zgargani haqida xabar berdi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_GetHelpActivate_Description:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Yordam olish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_GEO_BLOCKED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ayni paytda ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimini faollashtirib bo‘lmaydi, chunki siz kiritgan mahsulot kaliti siz joylashgan mamlakat yoki mintaqaga mos kelmayapti. Asl Windows versiyasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_EXPIRING_VOLUME:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: . Mahsulot kalitini olish uchun tizim ma’muri bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_EXPIRING_TBL:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: . Bu sanadan so‘ng, Windowsni shaxsiylashtira olmaysiz.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_EXPIRING_START:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows litsenziyangiz amal qilish muddati:
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_EXPIRING_PRERELEASE:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: . Yangi litsenziya olish uchun Windowsning so‘nggi versiyasini o‘rnatishingiz lozim. Agar o‘rnatmasangiz, ushbu litsenziya muddati o‘tgandan so‘ng ShKingiz har ikki soatda qayta ishga tushiriladi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Xato tavsifi:
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ErrorCode:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Xato kodi:
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_DOWNLEVEL_SETUPKEY:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows qurilmangizda avvalgi Windows versiyasining mahsulot kaliti bilan bog‘liq muammo haqida xabar berdi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_DEFAULT_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: We can’t activate Windows on this device because you don’t have a valid digital license or product key. If you think you do have a valid license or key, select Troubleshoot.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_CSS_TEXT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar Siz Windowsni qayta o‘rnatgan yoki apparat o‘zgarishlarini amalga oshirgan bo‘lsangiz, joriy kalitdan foydalanish imkoniga ega bo‘lishingiz mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_COA_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu mahsulot kaliti faqatgina Windows dastlab o‘rnatilgan tizimlarda Windowsni tiklash uchun ishlatilishi mumkin. Windowsni telefon orqali faollashtirishingiz mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePK_Volume_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Asl Windows versiyasini olish uchun boshqa mahsulot kalitini kiriting. Agar sizda mahsulot kaliti bo‘lmasa, tizim administratori bilan bog‘laning.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePK_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Asl Windows versiyasini olish yoki mahsulot kalitini kiritish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePKProfessionalSModeDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: %1 nashriga o‘tish uchun Storeni oching.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePKMessage:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu qurilmada boshqa mahsulot kalitidan foydalanish uchun Mahsulot kalitini almashtirishni tanlang.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePKInstructions:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu qurilmada boshqa mahsulot kalitidan foydalanish uchun Mahsulot kalitini almashtirishni tanlang.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePKDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Mahsulot kalitini o‘zgartirish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_ChangePKCoreClientDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows versiyasini yangilash yoki mahsulot kalitini kiritish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_CallSupport_ActionDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Agar Windowsni qayta o‘rnatgan yoki apparat ta’minotingizga o‘zgartirishlar kiritigan bo‘lsangiz, yordamga murojaat qiling 
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_CallSupportDescription:
