  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_BuyKeyDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Storeni ochish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_BLOCKED_PRODUCT_KEY_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu kompyuterda ishlatilgan mahsulot kaliti Windowsning ushbu versiyasida ishlamadi. Windowsni sotib olgan do‘kon yoki firmangiz bilan bog‘laning, boshqa mahsulot kalitini kiriting yoki Windowsning litsenziyalangan nusxasini sotib olish uchun Storega kiring.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_BIOS_KEY:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows OEM mahsulot kaliti bilan bog‘liq muammo mavjudligi haqida xabar berdi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_BenefitMessageDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Windows’ning litsenziyalanmagan nusxasidan foydalanish virus va boshqa xavfsizlik tahdidlari ostida qoldirishi mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_AVS_ERROR_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ushbu qurilmada Windows tizimi faollashtirib bo‘lmayapti, chunki ayni paytda aktivatsiya serverlarimiz ishlamayapti. Internet aloqasini tekshirib ko‘ring, keyin biz serverlar ish faoliyatiga o‘tganida Windows tizimini faollashtirishga avtomatik urinib ko‘ramiz.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activation_AltInstructions_Description:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: For information about activation of your Windows device, click the link below.
