  \resources\SystemSettings_Activate_DOWNLEVEL_NOT_ACTIVATED:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: We can’t activate Windows on this device as the previous version of Windows was not activated prior to upgrading to Windows 11. Go to the Store to buy genuine Windows.
