  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_RemoveUserButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Olib tashlash
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_PeopleOnDeviceDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Bu qurilmada hisobiga kira oladigan foydalanuvchini qoʻshing. Ular oilaviy guruhingizga qoʻshilmaydi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_OtherUsersDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Oilangiz a’zosi bo‘lmagan foydalanuvchilarga o‘z hisob qaydnomalari bilan kirish uchun ruxsat bering. Bunday qilish ularni oilangizga qo‘shmaydi.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_MSAConnectButton2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Sign in
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_MSAConnectButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Microsoft hisob qaydnomasi bilan kirish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_LocalAccount:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Mahalliy hisob qaydnomasi
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyUsersNoMembersDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Oilangizni qo‘shing va uning har bir a’zosiga alohida kirish va ishchi stol yarating. Mos veb-saytlar, vaqt, ilova va o‘yin cheklovlari yordamida bolalar xavfsizligini ta’minlashga yordam berishingiz mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyUsersDescription2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Let family members sign in to this PC—organizers can help keep members safer online with safety settings
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyUsersDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: You can allow family members to sign in to this PC. Organizers can manage family settings online and see recent activity to help kids stay safe.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilySync_ConnectionErrorDescription2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: We couldn’t connect to Microsoft Family Safety right now, so changes you make to family settings might not save.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilySync_ConnectionErrorDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Ayni vaqtda Microsoft oilasiga ulana olmadik, shu sababli ushbu qurilmadagi oilangiz eng oxirgi versiyada bo‘lmasligi mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyOnlineButton2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Manage family settings online or remove an account
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyOnlineButton:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Oila sozlamalarini onlayn tarzda boshqarish
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyMSAConnectDescription3:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Sign in with a Microsoft account to manage your family group
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyMSAConnectDescription2:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Sign in with a Microsoft account to see your family and add members
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyMSAConnectDescription:
    Candidate Language=UZ-LATN-UZ: Oilangizni ko`rish yoki oilangizga yangi a`zolarni qo`shish uchun tizimga Microsoft hisob qaydnomasi bilan kiring. Yoshiga mos keladigan veb-saytlar, vaqt cheklovlari. ilovalar va o`yinlar yordamida bolalaringizni xavfsiz saqlashingiz mumkin.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Accounts_FamilyLearnMoreButton2:
